        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Longines, The Swatch Group\n- People: Auguste Agassiz, Nicolas Hayek\n- Places: Saint-Imier, Switzerland\n- Concepts: luxury watch company, Swiss watch and jewelry manufacturer, corporate merger\n\nFacts:\n- Longines was founded by Auguste Agassiz in 1832.\n- The Swatch Group was founded in 1983 by Nicolas Hayek through the merger of Allgemeine Gesellschaft der Schweizerischen Uhrenindustrie (ASUAG) and Société Suisse pour l'Industrie Horlogère (SSIH).\n- Longines is a luxury watch company based in Saint-Imier, Switzerland.\n- The Swatch Group is a Swiss manufacturer of watches and jewelry.\n- Longines is currently owned by The Swatch Group.",
